data: {"text":"1. My client M/s Ganga Construction Pvt. Ltd. is a company incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, having"}

data: {"text":" its registered office at Industrial Area, Patna, Bihar, and is engaged in the business of construction and infrastructure development works. The company has been undert"}

data: {"text":"aking various government construction projects across Bihar with an impeccable track record and has established itself as a reliable contractor in the field"}

data: {"text":" of road construction and allied works.\n\n2. My client M/s Ganga Construction Pvt. Ltd. was"}

data: {"text":" awarded a contract for construction of culverts on NH-31 vide Work Order No. BRCD/PAT/2024/118 dated 12.06.2024 issued by your office"}

data: {"text":" for a total contract value of Rs. 2,75,00,000/- (Rupees Two Crores Seventy Five Lakhs only). The said"}

data: {"text":" work order contained detailed specifications, timelines, and terms and"}

data: {"text":" conditions for execution of the construction work as per the approved technical specifications and quality"}

data: {"text":" standards.\n\n3. My client diligently commenced the construction work immediately upon receipt of the work"}

data: {"text":" order and executed the entire project with utmost professionalism, adhering to all technical"}

data: {"text":" specifications, quality parameters, and safety norms prescribed under the contract. The construction work was carried out under"}

data: {"text":" the supervision and monitoring of the site engineer appointed by your department, who regularly"}

data: {"text":" inspected the progress and quality of work being executed.\n\n4. My client successfully completed all the contracted work by 28.02.2026 in accordance with the terms"}

data: {"text":" and conditions of the work order and submitted the final running bills along with measurement books duly signed and certified by the site engineer posted"}

data: {"text":" at the project site. The completion of work was duly verified and accepted by the compet"}

data: {"text":"ent technical officers of your department, and all requisite clearances and approvals were obtained as"}

data: {"text":" per the contractual obligations.\n\n5. Despite completion of the work and submission of all required documents, my client has repeatedly"}

data: {"text":" requested for release of the final payment through various communications dated 05.03.2026, 22.03.2026, and 18.04.2026"}

data: {"text":", copy of which are enclosed herewith for your ready reference. However, you have failed and"}

data: {"text":" neglected to release the outstanding final payment of Rs. 87,50,000/- (Rupees Eighty Seven Lakhs Fifty Thousand only) which has"}

data: {"text":" remained due and payable since 28.02.2026.\n\n6. The wrongful withholding of the legitimate payment due"}

data: {"text":" to my client has caused severe financial hardship, operational difficulties, and reputational damage to my client's"}

data: {"text":" business operations. The delayed payment has disrupted my client's cash flow, affecting its ability to service"}

data: {"text":" existing commitments and undertake new projects, thereby causing quantifiable financial loss"}

data: {"text":" and damage to business reputation in the construction industry.\n\n7. I am constrained to serve"}

data: {"text":" this legal notice upon you in compliance with the mandatory provisions of Section 80 of the Code of Civil"}

data: {"text":" Procedure, 1908, which requires service of two months' prior notice before instituting any suit against the"}

data: {"text":" Government or a public officer in respect of any act purporting to be done in official"}

data: {"text":" capacity.\n\n8. You are hereby called upon to release the outstanding payment of Rs. 87,50,000/- along with applicable"}

data: {"text":" interest within a period of two months from the date of service of this notice, failing which my client shall be constrained to init"}

data: {"text":"iate appropriate legal proceedings against you and the State Government for recovery of the said amount along with interest"}

data: {"text":", damages, and costs, without any further reference to you"}

data: {"text":" in the matter."}

